This file was created by accident while the PR author's GitHub-tool gateway
was retrying a failed branch-creation call. It carries no code, no secrets,
and is not one of this PR's intended deliverables.

The available tooling for this PR has no file-deletion capability, so this
placeholder could not be removed programmatically. Please delete this file
(`.github/_baseline_probe.tmp`) before or during merge, e.g. from the GitHub
web UI's "Delete file" action, or as part of a squash-merge that drops the
commit that introduced it.
